    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Routing operations \u00b7 evidence scope",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Received counter estimates for the selected window. Delayed telemetry may be absent; no data is not zero. Routing selection share does not establish cost savings or model quality.\n\nLatency histograms include failed Jev attempts. Sparse/idle worker samples can leave gaps. Use **Query inspector** to distinguish datasource failures from no data.\n\nDelivery health is the last received snapshot. Workers exit after five minutes per run; later calls restart them; last-success trails by one flush. Health panels ignore the agent/project/user filters. Coalesced and dropped health counters show lifetime totals from the last received snapshot."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Subagent calls",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(smr_calls_total{instance=~\"$instance\",agent=~\"$agent\",project=~\"$project\",user=~\"$user\"}[$__range]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}}",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "noValue": "No data"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
